{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jaeger is a third-person MOBA game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character Class </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six distinct character classes: <strong>Sharpshooter, Berserker, Defender, Elementalist, Healer, and Assassin</strong>. Each class features a <strong>unique weapon and specialized skills</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Leveling System ( Player Stats ) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players <strong>level up</strong>, they can freely allocate <strong>stat points</strong> and <strong>learn new skills</strong> to customize their character. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Weapons with Skills </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon boasts <strong>unique skills</strong> and specific requirements. Players can <strong>purchase weapons during a match</strong>.    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1417650?t=1754692540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1417650?t=1754692540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754692540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754692540","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1713780,"description":""}],"detailed_descript